OL,3,GNEWSADigital Greenhouse closure is
OL,4,A'absolutely crazy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA politician who launched a future
OL,7,Finnovation project has criticised plans
OL,8,Fto close the government-backed hub.
OL,10,FThe States of Guernsey announced that
OL,11,Fthe Digital Greenhouse, which opened in
OL,12,F2016, would close in its current form
OL,13,Funless a private company or charity
OL,14,Fcame forward to run it.
OL,16,FThe move followed a review by the
OL,17,FCommittee for Economic Development,
OL,18,Fwhich said the private and voluntary
OL,19,Fsectors were better placed to lead
OL,20,Ffuture innovation projects.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
