OL,3,GNEWSADigital Greenhouse closure is
OL,4,A'absolutely crazy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Commerce and Employment Minister
OL,7,FKevin Stewart, who helped create the
OL,8,Fcentre, said the decision was
OL,9,F"absolutely crazy".
